CM ============================================================
CM  TM-SC-NEC-001: Screwdriver Antenna — 10m Band
CM  2.4m whip, base loading coil, 4 horizontal elevated radials
CM  Frequency: 28.0–29.6 MHz (9 points, 0.2 MHz step)
CM
CM  Loading coil (series RL at base, segment 1 of GW1):
CM    R = 0.107 ohm  (Rcoil = Xant / Q, Q~400)
CM    X = 42.7 ohm   (XL required to resonate 2.4m whip on 10m)
CM
CM  Whip: 2.4m, avg radius 0.006m, 20 segments
CM  Radials: 4 x 2.4m at z=0.005m, 90 deg spacing
CM  Ground: real (Sommerfeld-Norton), eps=13, sigma=0.005
CM  Feed: 1V voltage source at GW1, seg 1
CM
CM  Tuning note: 10m requires minimal loading; coil fully retracted
CM  on a physical screwdriver. SWR minimum near 28.5 MHz.
